sequenceDiagram
    actor U as You (host)
    participant L as lease CLI
    participant A as broker-admin
    participant B as broker
    participant R as run.sh
    participant C as Agent container
    participant H as Host repo

    U->>L: lease approve --repo owner/repo
    L->>A: POST /v1/leases (X-Admin-Token)
    A-->>L: lease token lst_... (TTL 8h)
    U->>R: run.sh (safe mode)
    R->>R: check rootless Docker
    R->>R: stage ~/.claude allowlist, drop credentials
    R->>H: git clone --shared into session dir
    R->>C: start, uid 60917, LEASE_TOKEN + virtual key
    C->>B: GET /v1/token/github (bearer lease token)
    B-->>C: installation token (1h, repo-scoped)
    Note over C,H: Agent commits only inside the clone. Host hooks and config are never mounted.
    U->>L: lease grant id excalidraw --ttl 15m
    L->>A: POST grant (value read from KeePassXC on host)
    A->>B: store grant (shared state)
    C->>B: GET /v1/token/excalidraw
    B-->>C: value, in memory only, 15m TTL
    U->>R: run.sh review id
    R->>H: fetch session branch to refs/opencode/review/id
    R-->>U: diff stat + flagged executable config
    U->>H: git merge (your decision)
    U->>R: run.sh clean id
